    ogc:problem """Z, on tagging v0.2.0: "i still need to work through the model step by step and validate all the individual blocks and wires. and need to make sure we get a computational demonstration of our epo guaranteeing a complete record with full traceability and coverage. that is still work to come." The M-shapes check that the wiring is well formed; nothing yet shows that every run of the process must yield a record conforming to S0 to S8.""" ;
